# Enforcement-surface code owners.
#
# With `require_code_owner_review` enabled on the branch ruleset, any PR
# touching one of the paths below cannot merge without an approval from a
# non-author code owner. This is a server-side layer the judged PR's merge
# ref cannot edit away: a PR may neuter `pr_checks_slice.yml` in its own
# run, but it can no longer merge on that self-attested green.
#
# Both @mikkokotila and @zero-bang are named on every rule so either can
# approve the other's PR (no single-owner deadlock). This replaces the
# earlier global `* @zero-bang` review-request rule, which under
# `require_code_owner_review` would have made one owner a required approver
# for every PR in the repo.
/governance/ @mikkokotila @zero-bang
/.github/ @mikkokotila @zero-bang
/tests/test_packaging_surface.py @mikkokotila @zero-bang
